#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/index.md:12
msgid ""
"Choose reusable mechanisms by responsibility, then select the exact software"
" profile and its public CMake target. Components consume explicit ports and "
"caller-owned storage; products own scheduling, application policy and "
"physical recovery. Exact-profile storage headers belong only at static "
"composition."
msgstr ""
"按职责选择可复用机制，再选择精确的软件 profile 及其公开 CMake "
"target。组件使用显式端口和调用者拥有的存储；产品负责调度、应用策略和物理恢复。精确 profile 的存储头仅用于静态装配。"

