#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/index.md:26
msgid ""
"The [component guide](../../../guides/component-porting.md) connects "
"selection, static composition, progress and shutdown. An algorithm or helper"
" does not implicitly create a worker, queue, heap, device registry or "
"mandatory OS lock. An external asynchronous transport still owns its "
"accepted request and payload until acquire-observed SETTLED; a component's "
"timeout cannot revoke that borrow."
msgstr ""
"[组件指南](../../../guides/component-porting.md)串联选择、静态装配、推进和停机。算法或辅助机制不隐式创建 "
"worker、queue、heap、设备注册表或强制 OS lock。外部异步 transport 仍借用已接受的请求和 payload，直到 "
"acquire 观察 SETTLED；组件超时不能撤销该借用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/index.md:32
msgid ""
"The API reference describes current software contracts. It does not "
"authorize an unselected MCU mode, Board connection, kernel gateway or "
"physical result."
msgstr "API 参考描述当前软件合同，不授予未选定的 MCU 模式、板级连接、内核网关或物理结果。"
